%% Diagram source: docs/diagram/event-flow.mmd
sequenceDiagram
  participant R as PresenceRuntime
  participant B as Process-local event bus
  participant P as Producer
  participant V as Strict validator
  participant S as Retained state
  participant U as Presentation
  participant C as cmux

  R->>B: session start: ready v1
  B->>P: ready advertisement
  P->>B: update or optional replay
  B->>R: update v1
  R->>V: validate object and session
  Note over V: reject reserved source, stale fence,<br/>or source limit exceeded
  V->>S: replace accepted source state
  S->>U: current retained states
  U->>C: deterministic status / progress / attention
  R->>S: session teardown cleanup
  R->>C: clear owned output
